# SeizeGuard Phase 2 Prototype

## What This Does
Detects seizure-like accelerations and triggers an alarm within 500ms.

## How It Works
1. MPU6050 reads 3-axis acceleration continuously
2. Calculate magnitude: √(x² + y² + z²)
3. If magnitude > 1.65g → Trigger alarm
4. Press reset button to silence

## Components
- XIAO ESP32-S3 (MCU)
- MPU6050 (6-axis accelerometer)
- Piezo Buzzer (85dB)
- Red LED (visual alarm)
- Reset Button
- 1000mAh LiPo Battery

## Specifications
- Response Time: <500ms
- Battery Life: 28+ hours
- Cost: ₹4,000
- Power Consumption: 35mA average

